name: Saved study text stays exact and missing context never falls back
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/frozen_scanner_preview.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks agentic
submit: scan batch
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | plan
keys: Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE STUDY CONTEXT | context-picker
keys: Up Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | selected-alpha
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Context selected for this study | selected-context
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 Draft ready | prepared-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/frozen_scanner_preview.py @TMP_TARGET @ART prepared
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | saved-context
keys: p
require-live-snap: 20 Saved scanner text for this study | saved-projection
expect: matches this source at inspection
ask: Is it clear that this is the exact saved text for the finite study, with independent review still required and no implication that inspection approves model spending?
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | saved-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | saved-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | saved-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | saved-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | saved-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | saved-end-40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 15 SCANNER CONTEXT PREVIEW | saved-home-40x12
ask: Does paging and resizing preserve the selected context and distinguish saved request text from the complete document at forty columns?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | back-to-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/frozen_scanner_preview.py @TMP_TARGET @ART hide
keys: Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 25 Frozen scanner context is missing | missing-context
expect-not: Saved scanner text for this study
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/frozen_scanner_preview.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_MODEL=openai-codex:gpt-5.5 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | restored-plan
keys: Down Down Down Enter Enter
require-live-snap: 25 CONTEXT SUMMARY | restored-context
keys: p
require-live-snap: 20 Saved scanner text for this study | restored-saved-text
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/frozen_scanner_preview.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does missing saved context show a concrete refusal, and does no-color restart recover the same text without another context, job, allowance or model request?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | final-study
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
